# The behaviour menus with an arrow held (fixtures/outside). F2 pressed
# with Right held opens the menu of the sporty behaviour, which took
# Right for a change, so that LBA.EXE gave the aggressive one. Then Up
# held and Ctrl's menu: Right changes the behaviour, and the menu closes
# as Ctrl comes up, Twinsen walking on, where LBA.EXE waited for every
# arrow's release, the game stopped while Up stayed down.

hold 0.05
sleep 70
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot start
down Right
sleep 0.3
key F2
sleep 0.5
up Right
sleep 2
shot f2
down Up
sleep 1
down Control_L
sleep 0.5
key Right
sleep 0.5
up Control_L
sleep 2
shot ctrl
up Up
sleep 2
shot end
